    <string name="section_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_body">Likhon is a small, offline keyboard. It has no ads and never sends anything anywhere; the microphone is used only for voice typing. English is a standard QWERTY layout; Bangla is phonetic, so you type the sound in English letters.</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version 1.21</string>
    <string name="footer">Offline · No ads · Optional microphone</string>
    <string name="about_guide">Bangla typing guide</string>

    <string name="guide_title">Bangla typing guide</string>
    <string name="guide_body">Type words the way they sound.\n\nami → আমি\nkemon → কেমন\nbhalo → ভালো\nkorbo → করবো\ndesh → দেশ\nkintu → কিন্তু\n\nCapital letters give retroflex and long forms:\nT → ট   D → ড   N → ণ   S → ষ   R → ড়   O → ও   I → ঈ   U → ঊ\n\nng → ং   ^ → ্   ~ → ঁ   . → ।\n\n“o” is silent between consonants (kotha → কথা) and becomes ো at the end of a word (bhalo → ভালো).</string>

